{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33090","headline":"长安怀古 · 储嗣宗","name":"长安怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"祸稔萧墙终不知，生人力屈尽边陲。\n赤龙已赴东方暗，黄犬徒怀上蔡悲。\n面缺崩城山寂寂，土埋冤骨草离离。\n秋风解怨扶苏死，露泣烟愁红树枝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"储嗣宗","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_33090.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_33090","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}